<title>ITALY: TENNIS-ITALIAN OPEN WOMEN'S SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ITALIAN OPEN WOMEN'S SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinals results in the $926,250</p>
<p>Italian Open women's tennis tournament on Saturday (prefix</p>
<p>denotes seed):</p>
<p>10-Mary Pierce (France) beat 11-Barbara Paulus (Austria) 4-6</p>
<p>6-3 6-1</p>
<p>3-Conchita Martinez (Spain) beat Patty Schnyder (Switzerland) 6-2 6-2</p>
</text>
